de base. Replaced the `host_calback.call` with `io_callback`, since `host_callback` is [deprecated in JAX version 0.4.26](https://jax.readthedocs.io/en/latest/changelog.html#jax-0-4-36-dec-5-2024:~:text=The%20jax.experimental.host_callback%20module%20is%20deprecated.%20Use%20instead%20the%20new%20JAX%20external%20callbacks.%20Added%20JAX_HOST_CALLBACK_LEGACY%20flag%20to%20assist%20in%20the%20transition%20to%20the%20new%20callbacks.%20See%20%2320385%20for%20a%20discussion.) and [removed in JAX 0.4.35](https://jax.readthedocs.io/en/latest/changelog.html#jax-0-4-36-dec-5-2024:~:text=jax.experimental.host_callback%20has%20been%20deprecated%20since%20March%202024%2C%20with%20JAX%20version%200.4.26.%20Now%20we%20removed%20it.%20See%20%2320385%20for%20a%20discussion%20of%20alternatives.). Also changed the `type_complex` argument of `eig2` to `jnp.complex64` instead of `jnp.complex128`, since TPU does not support double precision. The modified code successfully runs on Colab TPU without any exceptions.\n\nPlease find the Colab [gist](https://colab.sandbox.google.com/gist/rajasekharporeddy/f29e98eb710a4a0e3a1679b46b60ff57/-13959.ipynb) for reference.\n\nThank you.","created_at":"2025-01-28T06:58:05Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/13959#issuecomment-2618070541","id":2618070541,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/13959","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc6cDJYN","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2618070541/reactions"},"updated_at":"2025-01-28T06:58:05Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2618070541","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153593711?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy/followers"