l":"https://api.github.com/users/yonghakim/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonghakim/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonghakim/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonghakim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonghakim/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonghakim","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88808?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skye/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skye/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skye/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skye/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/skye","id":88808,"login":"skye","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4ODA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skye/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skye/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skye/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skye/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skye/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skye","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88808?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skye/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skye/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skye/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skye/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/skye","id":88808,"login":"skye","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4ODA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skye/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skye/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skye/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skye/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skye/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skye","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"NONE","body":"### Description\n\nHi,\r\n\r\nI'm trying to do eigendecomposition of non-hermitian matrix on TPU in Colab.\r\nAs we know, it's available only on CPU so I enforced eig run on CPU with jit option.\r\n\r\nI tried 2 options.\r\n1. w/o host_callback\r\n2. w/  host_callback\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\nfrom functools import partial\r\n\r\nimport jax\r\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\r\nimport jax.tools.colab_tpu\r\njax.tools.colab_tpu.setup_tpu()\r\n\r\nfrom jax.experimental import host_callback\r\n\r\n@partial(jax.jit, backend='cpu')\r\ndef eig(mat):\r\n\r\n    print('eig')\r\n    return jnp.linalg.eig(mat)\r\n\r\n@partial(jax.jit, static_argnums=(1, ))\r\ndef eig2(matrix, type_complex=jnp.complex128):  #TODO: use type_complex arg\r\n    \"\"\"Wraps jnp.linalg.eig so that it can be jit-ed on a machine with GPUs.\"\"\"\r\n    eigenvalues_shape = jax.ShapeDtypeStruct(matrix.shape[:-1], type_complex)\r\n    eigenvectors_shape = jax.ShapeDtypeStruct(matrix.shape, type_complex)\r\n    return host_callback.call(\r\n        # We force this computation to be performed on the cpu by jit-ing and\r\n        # explicitly specifying the device.\r\n        jax.jit(jnp.linalg.eig, device=jax.devices('cpu')[0]),\r\n        matrix.astype(type_complex),\r\n        result_shape=(eigenvalues_shape, eigenvectors_shape),\r\n    )\r\n\r\naa = jnp.arange(9).reshape((3,3))\r\n\r\ntry:\r\n    eig(aa)\r\nexcept Exception as e:\r\n    print(1, e)\r\n\r\ntry:\r\n    eig(aa)\r\nexcept Exception as e:\r\n    print(2, e)\r\n\r\ntry:\r\n    eig2(aa)\r\nexcept Exception as e:\r\n    print(3, e)\r\n```\r\n\r\nResult\r\n```\r\neig\r\n2 Unable to cast Python instance to C++ type (#define PYBIND11_DETAILED_ERROR_MESSAGES or compile in debug mode for details)\r\n3 'NoneType' object has no attribute 'add_outfeed'\r\n<ipython-input-4-353dc3404a3b>:25: UserWarning: Explicitly requested dtype <class 'jax.numpy.complex128'> requested in astype is not available, and will be truncated to dtype complex64. To enable more dtypes, set the jax_enable_x64 configuration option or the JAX_ENABLE_X64 shell environment variable. See https://github.com/google/jax#current-gotchas for more.\r\n  matrix.astype(type_complex),\r\n```\r\nIn the first option, initial run was successful but the second outputs Error about casting.\r\nSecond option returned 'add_outfeed' error.\r\n\r\nare they bug or misused?\n\n### What jax/jaxlib version are you using?\n\njax 0.3.25,  jaxlib 0.3.25+cuda11.cudnn805\n\n### Which accelerator(s) are you using?\n\nTPU\n\n### Additional system info\n\ngoogle colab\n\n### NVIDIA GPU info\n\n_No response_","closed_at":"2025-01-28T15:46:48Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40263494?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonghakim/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonghakim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonghakim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonghakim/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yonghakim","id":40263494,"login":"yonghakim","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMjYzNDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonghakim/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonghakim/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonghakim/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonghakim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonghakim/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonghakim","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":3,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/13959/comments","created_at":"2023-01-11T0